<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KLTC to seek 5,580 tonnes of pork.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KLTC to seek 5,580 tonnes of pork.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Livestock Trading Corp on Thursday said it will invite tenders for 5,580 tonnes of frozen pork by 11.00 a.m. (0200 GMT) on February 28.</p>
</text>
